{"corpus":"ccc","number":1504,"text_html":"<span>Souvent Jésus<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§696</sup> demande aux malades de croire <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. Il se sert de signes pour guérir : salive et imposition des mains <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">2</sup>, boue et ablution <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">3</sup>. Les malades cherchent à le toucher <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">4</sup> « car une force sortait de lui qui les guérissait tous » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">5</sup>. Ainsi, dans les sacrements, le Christ continue à nous « toucher » pour nous guérir.</span>","cross_refs":["696"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mc 5:34"},{"text":"Mc 5:36"},{"text":"Mc 9:23"},{"text":"Mc 7:32-36"},{"text":"Mc 8:22-25"},{"text":"Jn 9:6"},{"text":"Mc 1:41"},{"text":"Mc 3:10"},{"text":"Mc 6:56"},{"text":"Lc 6:19"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 5:34","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"5:36","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"9:23","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 7:32-36","idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"8:22-25","idx":5,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 9:6 s","idx":6,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 1:41","idx":7,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"3:10","idx":8,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"6:56","idx":9,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 6:19","idx":10,"display_idx":5}]}